  "description": "Grab audio and video from the web. A TUI app to download MP3/MP4 from YouTube, TikTok, Instagram, Facebook, and 1000+ sites.",
  "id": "Naptrack",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-19T01:36:07.003Z",
